  "footnotes": [
   "昭和七年度組合員總數中ニハ八幡製鐵所現業員181,867人ヲ含ム。"
  ],
  "transcriber_notes": [
   "Rows: 組合員 5 (昭和 7-11 年度); 男女別 3; 收入金 6 (incl. 總額); 給與人員 8 (incl. 總數); 給與金額 8 (incl. 總額); 外地官廳現業員共濟組合數 5 (總數, 朝鮮, 臺灣, 樺太, 關東州 — 樺太 and 關東州 are printed in a second block to the right on the same lines and are joined here).",
   "Row labels in 給與人員 / 給與金額: the bracketed content lists printed under 公傷病給與金, 私傷病給與金, 脫退給與金 and 遺族給與金 are appended in parentheses to the label.",
   "Year labels: 昭和 and the year are printed in separate columns; '年度' beside the first year only, expanded onto each row.",
   "組合員: 昭和 7 row: the printed 總數 726,921 is 181,867 more than the sum of the ten columns (545,054); the footnote says the 昭和 7 total includes 181,867 八幡製鐵所現業員 (not a column). For 昭和 8, 9, 10, 11 the ten columns sum exactly to the printed 總數 (昭和 11: 陸軍 and 海軍 are '…'). 國有鐵道 昭和 7 is also printed 181,867 (re-read, as printed).",
   "男女別: 總數 row repeats the 昭和 11 組合員 row. 男 + 女 equals 總數 wherever both are printed (印刷局 2,324+1,746=4,070; 警察 71,464+—; 土木 6,962+50=7,012; 專賣局 14,917+14,322=29,239; 林野 10,625+—; 遞信 141,941+60,154=202,095).",
   "給與人員: the 7 item rows sum to the printed 總數 row in all columns except 國有鐵道 (printed 452,584; visible cells sum to 452,564, i.e. 20 less); the row 分娩給與金 prints 總數 17,658 but its ten visible cells sum to 17,638 (20 less). The cell 分娩給與金 / 國有鐵道 is printed '469' with the middle digit blurred (6 or 8). A reading 489 would reconcile both the row and the column totals, but this is a 6-vs-8 doubt, outside the stroke/3-vs-8 exceptions, so the cell is '[?]'. For every other row the 總數 column equals the sum of the ten columns.",
   "收入金: item rows sum to the printed 總額 exactly in 印刷局, 警察, 陸軍, 林野現業員, 遞信 and 國有鐵道; differences (items minus printed) of 1-2 in 土木事業從事員 (-1), 專賣局 (+1), 造幣局 (-1), 海軍 (-2), apparently rounding in print. In the 總數 column the cell 其ノ他ノ收入 is '[?]': the last digit of 5,085,65? is blurred (6 or 8). With 5,085,656 the items sum to 54,051,962, with 5,085,658 to 54,051,964, against printed 總額 54,051,967; neither reconciles, so it stays '[?]'.",
   "給與金額: for every item row the 總數 column equals the sum of the ten columns. Item rows sum to the printed 總額 within 1-3 (items minus printed): 總數 -2, 印刷局 +1, 土木事業從事員 +1, 造幣局 -1, 陸軍 -1, 海軍 -3, 林野現業員 +2, 遞信 -1; exactly in 警察, 專賣局, 國有鐵道. Cells re-read; kept as printed.",
   "Words printed inside cells are kept with the figure: '特別 35', '特別 11,310' (警察, 公傷病給與金); '婚姻 135' / '婚姻 11,158' (印刷局) and '學費 23,850' / '學費 178,630' (警察) and '健康保險 389' / '健康保險 14,833' (林野現業員), all in the row 其ノ他ノ給與金.",
   "收入金 其ノ他ノ收入 / 造幣局 '0' is a printed zero. Dash '—' and '…' as printed.",
   "外地: all rows and columns reconcile (13 = 4+5+2+2; 警察 3, 專賣 2, 營林 1, 遞信 4, 鐵道 3)."
  ],
